    "Veterinary: only Faith Veterinary Clinic is inside North Brunswick; every other nearby clinic is in East Brunswick, Somerset or Monmouth Junction.",
    "Day spas / med spas: very thin — the only med spa found in town (VIO Med Spa, Shoppes Blvd) is a franchise and was excluded; independent spas are limited to massage/skin-care studios on Route 130.",
