  "caveats": [
    "Google Maps served a limited 8-result view in this environment, so Bing Maps listings plus multiple directories were the primary source; Bing result sets cap at roughly 8-17 businesses per query.",
    "Excluded as chains/franchises encountered: Kessler Rehabilitation, JAG Physical Therapy, Twin Boro PT, Professional PT, SportsMed PT, PM Pediatric Urgent Care, VIO Med Spa, LifeStance/NJBH Therapies, Great Clips, Planet Fitness, Crunch, Retro Fitness, UFC GYM, LA Fitness, Hand & Stone, Ulta, Costco Hearing Aid.",
    "Advocare, KK Dental and Brilliant Smiles are small-to-mid practice networks; their local offices are listed because they run as separate offices, but ownership should be confirmed.",
    "Several salons appear only in bulk salon directories with no map presence (Zoyce, F&Y Chic, Belkys, D'Clase Doobie, villalona, Salon G and Spa, WEAR ME HAIR) — those need phone/status confirmation."
  ],
  "data_gaps": [
    "OpenStreetMap/Overpass API was unreachable here (HTTP 406 and timeouts), so no OSM cross-check was possible.",
    "YellowPages, Cylex, ChamberofCommerce.com and ShowMeLocal returned 403 or JS-only pages; Yelp and Zocdoc were not usable without heavy JS.",
    "Individual physician offices not surfaced by map queries are likely undercounted; several Route 27/Route 130 offices sit on the New Brunswick boundary and may be split between towns.",
    "One hair salon listed by a directory at '1562 US-130, second floor' had no business name in any source; a massage spa (Lakeside) occupies that address, so the salon entry was omitted."
  ]
